onflictResolver:`Inspect supplied typed candidates, select one and explicitly request confirmation without persisting a resolution.`,ValidationSummary:`Inspect consumer-reported validation status and complete supplied issues without running validation or inferring validity.`,RecordInspector:`Select a current supplied record field and inspect its complete typed value and evidence.`,FieldConfidenceList:`Inspect complete supplied field values and evidence with reported confidence, including zero and absence.`,ApprovalChecklist:`Review required checklist items before emitting an explicit approval intent.`,BeforeSubmitConfirmation:`Review current field values and explicitly consent before submission intent.`,DestructiveActionGuard:`Review exact impact, type the confirmation phrase and explicitly consent to destructive intent.`,HumanOverridePanel:`Select an alternative and explain an explicitly consented human override.`,PermissionRequestCard:`Review requested scopes and explicitly request or deny consumer-owned permission intent.`,ConfirmationPanel:`Review current change terms and explicitly confirm or cancel.`,RiskReviewPanel:`Acknowledge identified risks and confirm the current mitigation terms.`,ToolCallCard:`Inspect exact tool arguments, outputs and execution status.`,ToolResultCard:`Inspect an explicit tool outcome and its complete structured result without executing a tool.`,RunningTaskCard:`Review consumer-reported task progress and explicitly request inspection or cancellation.`,PartialResultViewer:`Select reported result parts, inspect complete structured values and request an eligible part retry.`,QueuedStepList:`Review ordered step states and attempts, select a step and request an eligible retry.`,ToolTraceViewer:`Filter an ordered trace and inspect complete selected event details without starting a trace runtime.`,RetryableErrorState:`Request a retry of retained tool arguments when the consumer permits it.`,DynamicQuestionFlow:`Complete conditional questions 